{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L135-L147","doc":"**Transfer matrix identities** (`prop:transfer-matrix-identities`):\n\n**(i)** `T_pp · T_nn = T_nn · T_pp = I`;\n\n**(ii)** `T_pn² = ([2]_q²/4) · I` where `[2]_q = q + q⁻¹`.\n\nStated over a generic field `K` with `q ≠ 0` and `(2 : K) ≠ 0`\n(AGENTS.md §7c). This is the declaration resolved by the block's\n`lean.ref` URI `qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.transfer_matrix_identities`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:transfer-matrix-identities","label":"prop:transfer-matrix-identities","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/transfer-matrix-identities.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_det","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L122-L133","doc":"The mixed crossing is not unimodular:\n`det T_pn = −(1 + (q − q⁻¹)²/4)` — the algebraic average `½(σ + σ⁻¹)`\nis not a group element.  Needs `(2 : K) ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_trace","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L113-L120","doc":"The mixed crossing is traceless: `trace T_pn = 0`.  Needs\n`(2 : K) ≠ 0` — in characteristic 2 the half-integer coefficients of\nthe mixed crossing collapse and the trace is `q − q⁻¹` instead. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn_det","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L108-L111","doc":"Unimodularity of the nn crossing: `det T_nn = −1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp_det","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp_det","kind":"theorem","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L102-L106","doc":"Unimodularity of the pp crossing: `det T_pp = −1` (forced by the\nHecke eigenvalues `q·(−q⁻¹) = −1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn_sq","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L85-L100","doc":"**Identity (ii)**: `T_pn² = ([2]_q²/4) · I` with `[2]_q = q + q⁻¹`.\nThe diagonal entry is `1 + (q − q⁻¹)²/4 = (q + q⁻¹)²/4` (using\n`q·q⁻¹ = 1`), and the off-diagonal entries cancel:\n`(h/2)·1 + 1·(−h/2) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn_mul_T_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn_mul_T_pp","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L78-L83","doc":"**Identity (i), right factor**: `T_nn · T_pp = I`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp_mul_T_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp_mul_T_nn","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L70-L76","doc":"**Identity (i), left factor**: `T_pp · T_nn = I`.  A ring identity\nin `h = q − q⁻¹` — no hypothesis on `q` is needed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pn","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L64-L68","doc":"Mixed (proton–neutron) crossing transfer matrix\n`T_pn = T(1, −(q − q⁻¹)/2)`, from the algebraic average\n`½(σ + σ⁻¹)` of the two Hecke crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_nn","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L58-L62","doc":"Neutron–neutron crossing transfer matrix `T_nn = T(1, −(q − q⁻¹))` —\nthe unique convention consistent with the Hecke inverse relation\n`σ⁻¹ = σ − (q − q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.T_pp","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L54-L56","doc":"Proton–proton crossing transfer matrix `T_pp = T(1, 0)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.transferMatrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.transferMatrix","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/transfer_matrix_identities.lean#L48-L52","doc":"General crossing transfer matrix\n`T(c, d) = !![c·(q − q⁻¹) + d, c; c, d]` of\n`prop:beta-decay-transfer-matrix`, over a generic field `K`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}